 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "data[0] is a header and is skipped. A data row is valid when: it splits on commas into exactly 6 fields; no field is empty or has leading/trailing spaces; field1 (id) is ASCII alphanumeric and differs from every earlier valid row id; field5 (amount) is a non-negative integer without leading zeros, optionally with exactly two decimals; field6 is a real calendar date YYYY-MM-DD in 1900..2099; fields 2-4 contain no forbidden word (words = maximal lowercase [a-z0-9] runs); and the word sequence of field2 differs from that of field3 after removing ignore words. Return the indices (into data) of valid rows in ascending order.",
